- Yes, ma, am.

291
00:16:38,908 --> 00:16:41,638
So how's the journalistic career?

292
00:16:42,412 --> 00:16:43,879
Well...

293
00:16:43,913 --> 00:16:45,778
- ... it's...
- You know, I still pick up...

294
