395
00:22:10,606 --> 00:22:11,937
What? You've got to tell me.

396
00:22:12,108 --> 00:22:14,609
What's the matter with you?
The Caldwells are hearing.

397
00:22:14,610 --> 00:22:16,601
Did Mom have an affair in Cabo
